{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a relaxing walk through the woods as Snouty, a young pig eager to explore every inch of the magical world he calls home. Snouty's motivations are simple: to collect as many shiny acorns and tasty mushrooms as he can! But little does he know, a greater destiny lays in store for him...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being gifted a legendary sword, Snouty is tasked with saving the forests. Roam across a wide fantasy realm and interact with a rich cast of characters as you fight against malicious magic and uncover the mysteries of the Great Rift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this open-world action RPG, you will explore the woodlands and dive into a fairytale narrative. The game also features many collect-a-thon elements, encouraging you to scour every corner of the map for those hidden golden acorns. Although interspersed with real-time action combat episodes, the game is primarily a relaxing experience, containing a fantasy-inspired soundtrack and minimal, stripped-back gameplay systems that make it easy to immerse yourself in Snouty's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snouty And The Great Rift is a fantasy adventure inspired by many walks in the woods. Whether you are young or old, whether you enjoy the thrill of combat or the peace of wind blowing in the trees, your experience with this game will be fresh and unique.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132790?t=1764883065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132790/b8d65201606807a7e79f69368ab0480ff6dd8b27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764883065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132790/976ebec19691070b0e269f554f455648e3a1fe1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764883065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor