e trees, your experience with this game will be fresh and unique.</p>","developers":["Pigman Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132790/2c7f195c9e18c9e06b3fcfa721c95ac961f38a27/header.jpg?t=1764883065","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132790/911933012/3a87a33b630c9c60e51530559b49bfadcbd03c4e/1762551896/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762552748","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132790/911933012/3a87a33b630c9c60e51530559b49bfadcbd03c4e/1762551896/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762552748","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132790/911933012/3a87a33b630c9c60e51530559b49bfadcbd03c4e/1762551896/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762552748","id":257228371,"name":"Snouty And The Great Rift - Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228371/5b23a2ec0c3993c7c4ca6f2fe26a561d37c3551c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762552748"}],"name":"Snouty And The Great Rift","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 / Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 7790 2GB / GeForce GTX 750Ti 2GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB availab